w=80 h=24
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|           Two windows, one app — synced by a shared Reactive::Signal           |
|                                                                                |
| ┌─ Window 1 ─────────────────────────┐  ┌─ Window 2 ─────────────────────────┐ |
| │                                    │  │                                    │ |
| │  Window 1 — sender                 │  │  Window 2 — receiver               │ |
| │  A separate window (its own        │  │  Nothing here is set directly;     │ |
| │  Screen/terminal). Drag or         │  │  it follows the shared             │ |
| │  key the slider:                   │  │  signal:                           │ |
| │                                    │  │                                    │ |
| │  ────────────█──40───────────────  │  │                                    │ |
| │  ·───────·───█───·──────·───────·  │  │                                    │ |
| │                                    │  │           _                        │ |
| │                                    │  │      |_| | |                       │ |
| │                                    │  │        | |_|                       │ |
| │                                    │  │                                    │ |
| │                                    │  │                                    │ |
| │                                    │  │                                    │ |
| │                                    │  │                                    │ |
| │  slider.on(ValueChanged)           │  │  Reactive.bind(bar, volume)        │ |
| │    volume.value = slider.value     │  │    bar.value = volume.value        │ |
| │                                    │  │                                    │ |
| └────────────────────────────────────┘  └────────────────────────────────────┘ |
|                                                                                |
|               run with --spawn to open two real terminal windows               |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
